<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
<!-- ============================================================
     Common head resources -- loaded on every real page. Kept in sync
     by sync_head.py (run from \testing\): it reads this file and
     replaces everything between the HEAD-COMMON:START/END markers on
     each listed page. To update sitewide: edit ONLY this file, then
     re-run `python sync_head.py`. Never hand-edit the marked block on
     an individual page -- the next sync will overwrite it.

     DO NOT put page-specific meta (title, description, OG/Twitter,
     canonical, JSON-LD schema, robots) or page-only assets (calculator
     CSS/JS, print_style_fix_v4.css, qrcode.min.js,
     affiliate-click-tracker.js, the Estimator's own scripts) here --
     those stay outside the markers, per page.

     DELIBERATELY NOT included here, even though every other page
     shares them, because they are not actually safe to force onto
     every page uniformly:
       - Bootstrap CSS: 18 of 19 pages use 4.5.2 (stackpath CDN), but
         estimate.html runs on Bootstrap 5.3.0 (jsdelivr) with no
         jQuery/Popper -- a real, load-bearing difference, not drift.
         Stays page-specific everywhere.
       - global-account-modal.js: loaded on every page, but not always
         from <head> -- estimate.html loads it near the end of <body>
         instead (its own loginModal/bizInfoModal markup was already
         removed in favor of the ones it injects -- a completed
         migration, not a gap). Left where it is rather than moved into
         head, to avoid touching that page's script order. Stays
         page-specific everywhere; cookie.html/privacy.html/terms.html/
         trello-setup.html were genuinely missing it anywhere on the
         page (a real "Log In" dead link) and got it added directly,
         once, outside their markers.
     ============================================================ -->

<!-- Web app manifest ("Add to Home Screen") -->
<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">

<!-- Favicon -->
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/Think-and-Engage-Logo1c-Black-Seal.png">

<!-- Google Fonts: Inter + IBM Plex Mono -- used by the sitewide dark
     header/footer/floating-action chrome and by mekpcalc.css. Approved
     design: Magic Patterns (https://www.magicpatterns.com/c/igj1coepi9s4kwq41co9iw).
     style.css no longer @imports these itself now that this link is
     finally live on every real page (see style.css's top-of-file
     comment) -- loading both would double-fetch the same stylesheet. -->
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">

<!-- Site stylesheet -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">

<!-- Chatbot styles -- chatbot.js/Library/Chatbot.lbi loads on every
     page, so its stylesheet needs to as well (it was missing on 7
     pages before this). -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/chatbot_styles.css">

<!-- Google Analytics -->
<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-DTECSH4N52"></script>
<script>
  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
  gtag('js', new Date());
  gtag('config', 'G-DTECSH4N52');
</script>

<!-- Meta Pixel -->
<script src="/meta-pixel.js"></script>

<!-- Supabase -->
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2"></script>
<script src="/supabase-client.js"></script>
<script src="/global-auth.js"></script>
